- Reverted the inline Progression section on the profile page back to
  the checklist + rank ladder version (as it was before)
- New 'Progression' button in the profile's navigation list (matches
  the mockup's FONCTIONNALITÉS entry), opens a dedicated
  ProgressionScreen with the GamifScreen-style content: level card,
  today's missions, badges (computed from real stats), and barème
  (from GET /settings/bareme) — same content as before, just moved
  to its own screen instead of being embedded on the profile page
